  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "The number of lollipops sold by each student is not given. Therefore, the total cannot be determined from the information provided.\n\nIf student \\(i\\) sold \\(l_i\\) lollipops, then the total is\n\n\\[\nl_1+l_2+\\cdots+l_{32}.\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{The total number of lollipops cannot be determined.}}\n\\]",
    "The number of lollipops each student sold is still not provided. With 30 students, the total would be\n\n\\[\n30 \\times (\\text{lollipops sold per student}),\n\\]\n\nbut the total cannot be determined without that number.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined from the information given}}\n\\]",
    "To find how many lollipops each student needed to sell, divide the class goal by the number of students:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{360}{30}=12\n\\]\n\nEach student needed to sell:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{12\\text{ lollipops}}\n\\]",
